# Auto Car Repair Website — Design System Rules

## Stack
- Next.js 14 App Router
- Tailwind CSS
- Framer Motion for ALL animations
- Mobile-first always

## Design Language
- Style: Glassmorphism + Dark luxury
- Primary color: gold `#C9A227` (no red — accents use gold + bale teal)
- Background: #0A0A0A (near black)
- Glass: backdrop-blur-md bg-white/10 border border-white/20
- Font: Inter (headings bold, body regular)
- Radius: rounded-2xl for cards, rounded-full for buttons
- Spacing: 8px base grid

## Mobile Bottom Navigation Rule
- On mobile: fixed bottom nav with glassmorphism
- Height: 64px, backdrop-blur-xl, bg-black/60
- Icons + labels, active state with primary color
- NEVER use top hamburger menu on mobile

## Hero Section Rule
- Full viewport height
- Dark car image as background (optimized WebP)
- Glass cards floating over the image
- Headline: large, bold, white
- Sub: muted gray
- CTA: Bale button (`bale-btn` — bg `#0a2221`, logo SVG) + gold booking button

## Glass Card Recipe
```css
bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/20 
rounded-2xl shadow-xl
```

## SEO Rules
- Every page: unique <title>, <meta description>, OG tags
- Use next-seo package
- Persian + English content for bilingual SEO
- Schema.org LocalBusiness markup in JSON-LD
- Image alt tags always in Persian and English

## Performance Rules
- Images: next/image always, WebP format, lazy loading
- No heavy libraries
- Fonts: next/font/google
- Keep bundle < 200KB initial

## Trust Elements (always include)
- Google rating display (4.8★)
- Bale as primary messenger CTA
- Phone number visible above fold on mobile
- Address + map embed
- Before/After gallery section